<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 163,500 MT--a marketing-year high--improved 35 percent from the week earlier and 81 percent over the 4-week average.  Mexico (130,200 MT) was the major buyer.</p>
<p>Exports of 62,500 MT were down 48 percent from the previous week and the 4-week average.  The destinations were Mexico (38,800 MT), Japan (15,100 MT), and Honduras (8,600 MT).</p>
</text>
